::recipe

name: Lavacake
source: https://publicdomainrecipes.com/lavacake/
source author: benjamin-h
source license: Public domain (Unlicense)
units: metric
category: dessert
tags: chocolate, lava cake
dietary: vegetarian
serves: 4
active time: ~15m
total time: ~22m
image: lavacake.webp

::ingredients

(egg) 1
(flour) 25g
(butter) 25g + extra for greasing
(chocolate) 75g
(berries, for serving) as desired
(vanilla ice cream, for serving) as desired

::equipment

(oven)
(cupcake tin)

::instructions

(cupcake tin) <grease, butter>
(oven) <heat, 200c>

{batter} =
    (egg) +
    (flour) +
    (butter) +
    (chocolate)

{batter} <mix>
    <fill, cupcake tin>
    <bake, 200c, 7m>

{lava cakes} + (berries) + (vanilla ice cream)
    <serve, hot>
